  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;for which the matrix <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is singular, is"
  },
