  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the matrix to be singular, its determinant value should be zero<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>But,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is rejected</p><p>Hence, only one value in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
